# Hide in Plain Sight ({3}{G}): look at the top five cards of your library, cloak two of them, put the rest on the bottom in a
# random order. The top five are Grizzly Bears, Llanowar Elves, Island, Forest and Mox Pearl; Ornithopter is the sixth card and
# is never looked at, so it cannot be chosen, and a third card cannot be chosen either ("two"). Bot1 cloaks the first and the
# fifth card, Grizzly Bears and Mox Pearl, having looked at all five: two face-down 2/2 creatures with ward {2}, neither face up. The other three go
# to the bottom without Bot1 being asked for an order, leaving the sixth card on top, and Bot2's library is not touched
# (13 cards, as dealt). Paid with Black Lotus (GGG) and Mox Emerald. CR 701.58a, 701.20a, 401.4, 701.58e.

